["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>A deer that smells you is gone before you see it. You cannot hide scent, but you can put it where deer are not.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two top views. Good, ticked: the wind blows from the deer to you, so your scent drifts behind you, away from the deer. Bad, crossed: the wind blows from you to the deer, and your scent cone reaches it.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"188\" height=\"284\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\"/><rect x=\"204\" y=\"8\" width=\"188\" height=\"284\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#efe2d6\"/>\n  <text x=\"102\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f6e3b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Good</text>\n  <text x=\"298\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c0392b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bad</text>\n  <g transform=\"translate(102 76)\"><ellipse rx=\"20\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"-9\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/></g>\n  <path d=\"M60 110 L60 150\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"52,146 68,146 60,160\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n  <path d=\"M144 110 L144 150\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"136,146 152,146 144,160\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n  <path d=\"M102 196 L66 284 L138 284 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\" opacity=\".2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"102\" cy=\"196\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <text x=\"102\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">You</text>\n  <text x=\"102\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">scent behind you</text>\n  <g transform=\"translate(298 76)\"><ellipse rx=\"20\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"-9\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/></g>\n  <path d=\"M298 196 L262 60 L334 60 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\" opacity=\".2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"298\" cy=\"196\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <text x=\"298\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">You</text>\n  <path d=\"M256 170 L256 130\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"248,134 264,134 256,120\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n  <path d=\"M340 170 L340 130\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"332,134 348,134 340,120\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n  <text x=\"298\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">deer smells you</text>\n  <text x=\"102\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">wind</text>\n  <text x=\"298\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">wind</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Keep the deer <strong>upwind</strong>: the wind blows from the deer to you.</li></ul>","<figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation, top view. Your scent drifts like campfire smoke, away from a feeding deer. Then the light wind shifts and the scent plume swings toward the deer. The deer's head comes up and it bounds away. Light, shifting wind is the danger.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" opacity=\".5\"/>\n  <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Scent drifts like smoke</text>\n  <g>\n    <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"rotate\" values=\"0 120 220;0 120 220;-111 120 220;-111 120 220\" keyTimes=\"0;0.4;0.65;1\" dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <path d=\"M120 220 L230 190 L230 260 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\" opacity=\".18\"/>\n    <g fill=\"#e8590c\" opacity=\".55\">\n      <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"222\" r=\"4\"><animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"130;225\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"210\" r=\"4\"><animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"130;225\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\".7s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/><animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"218;198\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\".7s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></circle>\n      <circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"232\" r=\"4\"><animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"130;225\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\"1.3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/><animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"222;250\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\"1.3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></circle>\n    </g>\n  </g>\n  <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"220\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <text x=\"120\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">You</text>\n  <g>\n    <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;0 0;160 -40\" keyTimes=\"0;0.8;1\" dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <g transform=\"translate(70 90)\"><ellipse rx=\"20\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"><animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"6;6;-12;-12\" keyTimes=\"0;0.68;0.72;1\" dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></circle>\n    </g>\n  </g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"3.2s\" dur=\".4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <text x=\"388\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"end\">Wind shifts...</text></g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"7s\" dur=\".5s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"230\" width=\"190\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n    <text x=\"295\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Busted. Light, shifting</text>\n    <text x=\"295\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">wind is the danger</text></g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>Steady wind is your friend. Shifting wind is the danger. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>Your scent drifts with the air, like smoke from a campfire.</li><li>Deer rely heavily on smell to detect danger <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how scent moves, in full</summary><ul><li>Your scent drifts with the air, like smoke from a campfire.</li><li>Deer rely heavily on smell to detect danger <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Deer often travel with the wind at their back or side so they can smell behind and look ahead (60%, hunter observation).</li><li>Steady wind is your friend. Shifting, light wind is the danger.</li><li>Rule of thumb: keep the deer <strong>upwind</strong> of you. The wind blows from the deer to you.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation of one day on a slope. The sun rises and crosses the sky. In the morning the sun warms the slope and blue arrows show air rising uphill. Near sunset the air swirls as the thermals switch. In the evening the slope cools and the arrows flow downhill. Morning: be above the deer. Evening: be below.\"><rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fdf1d6\"><animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"#fdf1d6;#fffaf0;#e9dfcf\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></rect><g><circle r=\"16\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><animateMotion dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\" keyPoints=\"0;0.8;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.4;1\" calcMode=\"linear\" path=\"M40 150 Q 200 -40 380 150\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0.5\" keyTimes=\"0;0.7;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/></g><path d=\"M0 270 L300 90 L400 90 L400 300 L0 300 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"320,90 330,60 340,90\"/><polygon points=\"350,90 360,56 370,90\"/></g><g opacity=\"1\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.31;0.33;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><g><path d=\"M27.7 225.4 L68.8 200.7 M61.6 212.0 L68.8 200.7 L55.4 201.8\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M117.7 171.4 L158.8 146.7 M151.6 158.0 L158.8 146.7 L145.4 147.8\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M207.7 117.4 L248.8 92.7 M241.6 104.0 L248.8 92.7 L235.4 93.8\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;22.3 -13.4\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></g><text x=\"12\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Morning: sun warms the slope</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"start\">Air rises UPHILL</text></g><g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.31;0.33;0.65;0.67;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><g stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M90 200 c 20 -30, 50 -10, 30 10 c -15 15, -30 -5, -15 -15\"/><path d=\"M200 140 c -20 -30, -50 -10, -30 10 c 15 15, 30 -5, 15 -15\"/></g><text x=\"12\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Near sunset: the switch</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"start\">Air swirls, mixed</text></g><g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.65;0.67;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><g><path d=\"M68.8 200.7 L27.7 225.4 M41.0 224.4 L27.7 225.4 L34.9 214.1\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M158.8 146.7 L117.7 171.4 M131.0 170.4 L117.7 171.4 L124.9 160.1\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M248.8 92.7 L207.7 117.4 M221.0 116.4 L207.7 117.4 L214.9 106.1\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;-22.3 13.4\" dur=\"1.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></g><text x=\"12\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Evening: slope cools</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"start\">Air sinks DOWNHILL</text></g><g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.65;0.67;1\" dur=\"9s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"230\" width=\"200\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Morning: be above</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Evening: be below</text></g></svg>\n<figcaption>One day on a slope: up in the morning, down in the evening. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>Morning sun warms slopes: air rises <strong>uphill</strong> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Evening slopes cool: air sinks <strong>downhill</strong> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: thermals in full</summary><ul><li>Thermals are air currents made by the ground warming and cooling <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li><strong>Morning:</strong> the sun warms slopes and air rises <strong>uphill</strong> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li><strong>Evening:</strong> slopes cool and air sinks <strong>downhill</strong>, into draws and valley floors <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Shaded north slopes and timber stay cool longer, so the switch comes later there (Tip).</li><li>On calm days, thermals beat the light breeze. In strong wind, the wind wins (Tip).</li></ul></details><a class=\"yt-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2BLU08yQvqo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"yt-play\">▶</span><span class=\"yt-text\"><b>Understanding Thermals For Hunting</b><small>Warm air rises in the day, cool air sinks at night.<br>onX Hunt, YouTube, 5 min. Needs internet.</small></span></a>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 520\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"th-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"520\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Morning: sun warms slope, air rises</text>\n  <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"62\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#e8590c\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <path d=\"M10,240 L120,200 L260,90 L300,80 L390,150 L390,240 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <path d=\"M90,190 L150,160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#th-arrow)\"/>\n  <path d=\"M160,148 L215,108\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#th-arrow)\"/>\n  <path d=\"M225,96 L262,68\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#th-arrow)\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"76\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"275\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">You</text>\n  <ellipse cx=\"80\" cy=\"212\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"62\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Deer</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Be ABOVE. Scent goes up, away.</text>\n  <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"262\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"262\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Evening: slope cools, air sinks</text>\n  <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"322\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <path d=\"M10,500 L120,460 L260,350 L300,340 L390,410 L390,500 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <path d=\"M245,352 L195,390\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#th-arrow)\"/>\n  <path d=\"M185,400 L135,437\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#th-arrow)\"/>\n  <path d=\"M120,450 L70,470\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#th-arrow)\"/>\n  <ellipse cx=\"270\" cy=\"338\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Deer</text>\n  <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"470\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#6b4f35\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"48\" y=\"448\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">You</text>\n  <text x=\"250\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Be BELOW. Scent sinks, away.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Morning: be above the deer. Evening: be below (Tip).</li></ul>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Side view of wind crossing a ridge into a draw. Straight wind blows over the top, then tumbles and curls in the draw and against the timber below. In a swirl no setup is safe: back out.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <path d=\"M0 160 L120 70 L170 70 L250 230 L290 240 L400 150 L400 300 L0 300 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><polygon points=\"330,200 340,170 350,200\"/><polygon points=\"355,182 365,150 375,182\"/><polygon points=\"305,222 315,192 325,222\"/></g>\n  <g stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n    <path d=\"M10 60 L100 30\"/><path d=\"M90 26 l12 4 l-8 10\"/>\n    <path d=\"M110 30 L200 40\"/><path d=\"M188 32 l12 8 l-12 6\"/>\n    <path d=\"M200 120 c 40 -30, 70 10, 40 30 c -25 15, -40 -15, -15 -20\"/>\n    <path d=\"M250 190 c 30 -40, 70 -10, 50 20 c -15 20, -40 0, -25 -15\"/>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"12\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\">Steady wind over the top</text>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c0392b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Swirl in</text>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c0392b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the draw</text>\n  <rect x=\"12\" y=\"236\" width=\"196\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <text x=\"110\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No setup is safe here.</text>\n  <text x=\"110\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Back out, come back</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Wind swirls in draws, saddles, valleys and thick timber <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>In a swirl, no setup is safe. Back out.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: swirls in full</summary><ul><li>Wind swirls in draws, saddles, valleys and thick timber, where air bounces off terrain <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Swirl also happens around the switch time, mid morning and near sunset, as thermals change direction (Tip).</li><li>Lakes and creeks: cold air often slides down creek bottoms in the evening (Tip).</li><li>In a swirl, no setup is safe. Back out and come back with steadier air.</li></ul></details><a class=\"yt-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GldhsivkG5U\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"yt-play\">▶</span><span class=\"yt-text\"><b>Thermals Explained Using Video from Our Past Hunts</b><small>See thermals carry scent downhill in real hunt footage.<br>GrowingDeer.tv, YouTube, 6 min. Needs internet.</small></span></a>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"4\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Four ways to see the wind</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 4</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Wind check tool 1: a puffer bottle of unscented powder. One squeeze makes a small cloud that drifts and shows direction.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"70\" y=\"120\" width=\"60\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><rect x=\"88\" y=\"96\" width=\"24\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"96\" y=\"80\" width=\"8\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#c9b79c\" opacity=\".8\"><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"74\" r=\"10\"/><circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"66\" r=\"14\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"70\" r=\"18\"/><circle cx=\"246\" cy=\"78\" r=\"20\"/><circle cx=\"292\" cy=\"90\" r=\"22\" opacity=\".6\"/></g>\n  <path d=\"M190 130 L310 130\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"306,122 306,138 322,130\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n  <text x=\"250\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">drift = direction</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Puffer bottle</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">One puff of unscented powder (70%)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>1.</b> Puffer bottle: one puff shows drift.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Wind check tool 2: a milkweed fluff floats far. Its path climbs, stalls and curls back, showing thermals and swirls over the ground.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <path d=\"M0 260 L400 200 L400 300 L0 300 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 210 C 120 180, 180 120, 240 110 S 330 140, 300 90 S 250 60, 290 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\"/>\n  <g transform=\"translate(60 210)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g stroke=\"#c9b79c\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"-10\" y2=\"-12\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-15\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"-12\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"-14\" y2=\"-4\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"-4\"/></g></g>\n  <g transform=\"translate(290 50)\"><g stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"-10\" y2=\"-12\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-15\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"-12\"/></g></g>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Milkweed fluff</text>\n  <text x=\"250\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\">climbs, curls</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Shows thermals and swirls (70%)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> Milkweed: floats far, shows thermals and swirls.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Wind check tool 3: a lighter flame leans with the air, but only shows the air right at your hand. Mind fire risk in dry grass.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"170\" y=\"150\" width=\"50\" height=\"90\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"136\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M195 136 C 180 110, 210 100, 222 76 C 226 100, 214 120, 205 136 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <path d=\"M120 100 L170 100\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"166,92 166,108 180,100\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lighter flame</text>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Only the air</text>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">at your hand</text>\n  <rect x=\"40\" y=\"252\" width=\"320\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fire risk in dry grass (Tip)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Lighter: quick check at your hand only.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Wind check tool 4: a light thread tied to a rifle sling or bow. It is always on and shows the breeze without using your hands.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <path d=\"M60 220 L340 140\" stroke=\"#6b4f35\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <path d=\"M320 146 L360 134\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n  <path d=\"M120 200 C 110 130, 260 160, 240 90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n  <path d=\"M200 175 C 220 180, 240 170, 270 178 S 300 172, 320 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Thread on the sling</text>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"210\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">always on</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No hands needed (Tip)</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption><b>4.</b> Thread on the sling: always on.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><ul><li>Check every few minutes and at every new terrain feature.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: wind check tools in full</summary><ul><li><strong>Puffer bottle:</strong> a squeeze bottle of unscented powder. One puff shows drift and direction <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li><strong>Milkweed fluff:</strong> floats far and shows thermals and swirls over terrain <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li><strong>Lighter flame:</strong> quick check, shows only the air right at your hand (Tip). Mind fire risk in dry grass.</li><li><strong>Thread</strong> on your bow or rifle sling: always on, no hands (Tip).</li><li>Check every few minutes and at every new terrain feature, not just at the truck.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation: one milkweed tuft released on a slope. It drifts across, climbs uphill on the rising air, stalls, then curls back on itself in a swirl. Watch one tuft for 30 seconds.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <path d=\"M0 280 L400 140 L400 300 L0 300 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/>\n  <path id=\"hf-milkweed-path\" d=\"M70 240 C 140 220, 200 170, 250 150 C 310 126, 330 90, 290 80 C 250 70, 240 110, 280 112\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 6\" opacity=\".7\"/>\n  <g>\n    <g stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"-9\" y2=\"-11\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-14\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"-11\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"-13\" y2=\"-4\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"-4\"/></g>\n    <circle r=\"3\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/>\n    <animateMotion dur=\"8s\" fill=\"freeze\" keyPoints=\"0;0.5;0.62;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.45;0.65;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"><mpath href=\"#hf-milkweed-path\"/></animateMotion>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"12\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Release one tuft</text>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"2.5s\" dur=\".4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\">climbs</text></g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"4.5s\" dur=\".4s\" fill=\"freeze\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\">stalls</text></g>\n  <g opacity=\"0\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0;1\" begin=\"7.5s\" dur=\".5s\" fill=\"freeze\"/>\n    <rect x=\"12\" y=\"44\" width=\"200\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n    <text x=\"112\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Curls back = swirl.</text>\n    <text x=\"112\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Scent goes everywhere</text></g>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>Climb, stall, curl back: that curl is a swirl. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><aside class=\"callout tip\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Tip (opinion)</div><p>Milkweed is the best teacher. Watch one tuft for 30 seconds.</p></aside>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Plan A and plan B on a map. Spot A on the west side of a bench works in an east wind. Spot B on the south side works in a north wind. Forecast says north wind: go to B, do not force A.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" opacity=\".5\"/>\n  <ellipse cx=\"220\" cy=\"120\" rx=\"80\" ry=\"40\" fill=\"#e8590c\" opacity=\".2\"/>\n  <text x=\"220\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">bedding bench</text>\n  <circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"120\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text>\n  <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"230\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B</text>\n  <path d=\"M150 70 L110 70\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"114,62 114,78 100,70\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n  <text x=\"40\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">A: east wind</text>\n  <path d=\"M330 170 L330 210\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polygon points=\"322,206 338,206 330,220\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n  <text x=\"250\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">B: north wind</text>\n  <text x=\"388\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">N up</text>\n  <rect x=\"12\" y=\"236\" width=\"180\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <text x=\"102\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wrong wind for A?</text>\n  <text x=\"102\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd34d\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Go to B. Do not force A</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Plan an A and B spot for each wind. Wrong wind? Go to B.</li><li>Walk in with the wind in your face or across you.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the six planning steps</summary><ol><li>Check the forecast wind direction and speed the night before.</li><li>On the map, mark likely bedding and feeding areas.</li><li>Mornings: come in from <strong>above</strong> or from the side so rising air carries scent up and away.</li><li>Evenings: sit <strong>below</strong> or to the side so sinking air carries scent down and away.</li><li>Plan an A and B spot for each wind. Wrong wind on the day? Go to B, do not force A.</li><li>Walk in with the wind in your face or across you, never at your back toward the deer.</li></ol></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Field task chart. Stand mid slope three times on a scouting day: 7 am, 12 noon and 5 pm. Puff or release milkweed each time and draw which way it went in your journal. Blank boxes for your arrows.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Test the air 3 times, one day</text>\n  <g fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"12\" y=\"50\" width=\"120\" height=\"180\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"50\" width=\"120\" height=\"180\" rx=\"10\"/><rect x=\"268\" y=\"50\" width=\"120\" height=\"180\" rx=\"10\"/></g>\n  <g fill=\"#8a9a6b\"><path d=\"M20 210 L124 130 L124 222 L20 222 Z\"/><path d=\"M148 210 L252 130 L252 222 L148 222 Z\"/><path d=\"M276 210 L380 130 L380 222 L276 222 Z\"/></g>\n  <circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"172\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"172\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><circle cx=\"328\" cy=\"172\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"72\" y=\"80\">7 am</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"80\">12 noon</text><text x=\"328\" y=\"80\">5 pm</text></g>\n  <g fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"><rect x=\"42\" y=\"94\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"94\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\"/><rect x=\"298\" y=\"94\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\"/></g>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Draw the drift arrow in each box</text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Puffer or milkweed, mid slope</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Hunt the wind you have, not the wind you wanted.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Checking wind once at the truck, then hunting a swirling valley.</li><li>A morning seat above deer bedded higher up still.</li><li>Ignoring the evening switch.</li></ul></aside><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the mistakes in full</summary><ul><li>Checking wind once at the truck, then hunting a valley where it swirls.</li><li>Sitting on a morning ridge above deer that are bedded higher up, so rising air takes your scent right to them.</li><li>Ignoring the evening switch and staying at a midday spot as air begins to sink.</li></ul></details><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Stand mid slope at 7 am, 12 noon and 5 pm on a scouting day. Puff or release milkweed. Draw the drift in your journal.</p></aside>","<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.themeateater.com/wired-to-hunt/whitetail-hunting/understanding-thermals-in-whitetail-country\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MeatEater: Understanding thermals in whitetail country</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://realtree.com/articles/big-game-hunting/how-to-read-and-understand-mountain-wind\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Realtree: How to read and understand mountain wind</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://mossyoakgamekeeper.com/wildlife-management/whitetail-deer/deer-hunting-in-wind-and-thermals/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mossy Oak Gamekeeper: Deer hunting in wind and thermals</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (search preview)</li><li><a href=\"http://www.buckmasters.com/Hunting/Tips-and-Tactics/Articles/ID/543/Natural-Wind-Detector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buckmasters: Natural wind detector (milkweed)</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (search preview)</li><li>Hunt Mentor deer research notes, research/2026-10-01-deer.md, thermals line <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">80%</span></li><li>Note: thermals are basic physics. Hunting use is hunter experience, labelled Tip.</li></ul>"]